<title>GERMANY: Leica says H1 sales climbed to 98.5 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>Leica says H1 sales climbed to 98.5 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   1.9	vs 2.1 loss</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   0.7 loss vs 0.3 loss</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    4.7	vs 2.3 loss</p>
<p>    Group sales				  98.5     vs 96.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German camera group is Leica AG. The group said it expected sales to show a clear rise in the second half of the year.</p>
<p>The group recently listed its shares on the bourse.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
